    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#10 - giant earthworm\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,1826,1848]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As torrential rains pour from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,1848,1882]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sky, you seek shelter from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,1882,1913]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weather in a ramshackle hut. As\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,1913,1945]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you get close, the ground shakes\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,1945,1978]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and a giant earthworm lunges at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,1978,2010]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,2010,2015]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Giant Worm, L4 animal, 8 Life, on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,2015,2049]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any Defense roll of 1, it inflicts 2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,2049,2086]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage. 1 damage otherwise. Once\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,2086,2119]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "reduced to 4 or fewer Life, roll d6. On",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,2119,2158]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a 1 to 3  it will flee, retreating\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,22,57]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "underground; on a 4 to 6, it will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,57,91]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "continue to fight to the death.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,91,123]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you survive the fight, you find a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,123,160]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "random item in the hut. You also\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,160,193]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-010:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "gain 1 XP if you kill the giant worm.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[82,193,231]]"
    }
  ],
